{# The emailed copy of a notice that is already waiting in the application.

   Deliberately not a second, richer channel: it carries the same message the
   recipient will see when they sign in, and nothing the in-app notice does not
   have. An email is forwarded, indexed and read on somebody else's screen, so
   it names no administrator, quotes no report, and links to nothing that would
   act on the recipient's behalf if it were opened by the wrong person. #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>A notice about your {{ site_name }} account</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6d28d9;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .notice {
            background-color: #fffbeb;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
        }
        .context {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 28px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding-top: 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
    <div class="logo">{{ site_name }}</div>

    <p>Hello{% if recipient_name %} {{ recipient_name }}{% endif %},</p>

    <p>An administrator of {{ site_name }} has left a notice on your account.</p>

    {% if subject_label %}
        <p class="context">
            {% if subject == 'comic' %}
                This is about the comic <strong>{{ subject_label }}</strong>.
            {% elseif subject == 'share' %}
                This is about a comic you shared: <strong>{{ subject_label }}</strong>.
            {% else %}
                This is about <strong>{{ subject_label }}</strong>.
            {% endif %}
        </p>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="notice">{{ message }}</div>

    <p>The same notice is waiting for you when you next sign in, where you can dismiss it.</p>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>
            This message does not by itself change what you can read, upload or share. If you
            believe it was sent in error, reply to {{ contact_email }}.
        </p>
        <p>You are receiving this because you hold an account on {{ site_name }}.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
